guarantee: AC-4: a write failure notices stopped{storage}
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/session.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
            StopReason::MaxLength | StopReason::LowDisk | StopReason::StorageError => {
                CallNotice::Stopped { reason }
            }
            StopReason::User
--- new
            StopReason::MaxLength | StopReason::LowDisk => CallNotice::Stopped { reason },
            StopReason::StorageError
            | StopReason::User
--- end
